# See AGENTS.md at the repo root for full rules.

## This file points Cursor AI to the same conventions.

### Critical Rules

- pnpm monorepo: @vcard/web (Astro 5), @vcard/api (Hono), @vcard/shared (Zod schemas)
- Import aliases: always use `@/` for internal imports, never relative `../../`
- No .js extensions in imports (moduleResolution: bundler)
- NEVER set moduleResolution to NodeNext — use bundler
- Build: `tsc -b && tsc-alias -p tsconfig.json -f` rewrites @/ → relative in dist/
- Ukrainian UI text, English code comments and commits
- apps/web: pure Astro components, no React/Vue/Svelte, no client JS
- apps/api: barrel exports (index.ts) in every folder, Strategy pattern for providers
- Zod schemas go in @vcard/shared, not in api
- Docker CLI: `docker compose` (no hyphen)
- Commit format: `type(scope): short description` (English, lowercase, imperative, no period)
- pnpm v10.29.1 only — never npm/ƒyarn
